### Missing Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/process/{{testUserId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "measurements": [
    {
      "userId": "{{testUserId}}",
      "weight": 75.0,
      "source": "patient-device"
    }
  ]
}

### Invalid UUID Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/process/{{testUserId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "measurements": [
    {
      "uuid": "not-a-valid-uuid",
      "userId": "{{testUserId}}",
      "weight": 75.0,
      "unit": "kg",
      "timestamp": "2024-01-20T13:00:00Z",
      "effectiveDateTime": "2024-01-20T13:00:00Z",
      "source": "patient-device"
    }
  ]
}

### Empty Measurements Array
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/process/{{testUserId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "measurements": []
}

### ============================================
### PERFORMANCE TESTING
### ============================================

### Small Batch (5 measurements)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/process/{{testUserId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "measurements": [
    {"uuid": "b50e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440001", "userId": "{{testUserId}}", "weight": 75.0, "unit": "kg", "timestamp": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "effectiveDateTime": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "source": "patient-device"},
    {"uuid": "b50e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440002", "userId": "{{testUserId}}", "weight": 75.1, "unit": "kg", "timestamp": "2024-01-01T01:00:00Z", "effectiveDateTime": "2024-01-01T01:00:00Z", "source": "patient-device"},
    {"uuid": "b50e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440003", "userId": "{{testUserId}}", "weight": 75.2, "unit": "kg", "timestamp": "2024-01-01T02:00:00Z", "effectiveDateTime": "2024-01-01T02:00:00Z", "source": "patient-upload"},
    {"uuid": "b50e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440004", "userId": "{{testUserId}}", "weight": 75.0, "unit": "kg", "timestamp": "2024-01-01T03:00:00Z", "effectiveDateTime": "2024-01-01T03:00:00Z", "source": "care-team-upload"},
    {"uuid": "b50e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440005", "userId": "{{testUserId}}", "weight": 74.9, "unit": "kg", "timestamp": "2024-01-01T04:00:00Z", "effectiveDateTime": "2024-01-01T04:00:00Z", "source": "questionnaire"}
  ]
}